<% layout("./layouts/boilerplate") %>
<div class="privacy-page">

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="privacy-header">
        <div class="privacy-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
        </div>

        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
            Your privacy matters to us. Learn how WanderLust handles
            your information when you use our platform.
        </p>

        <small>Last Updated: November 2, 2026</small>
    </div>

    <!-- Privacy Content -->
    <div class="privacy-card">

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>1. Introduction</h4>
            <p>
                Welcome to WanderLust. We value your privacy and are committed
                to handling your personal information responsibly. This Privacy
                Policy explains what information may be collected, how it may
                be used, and how it is handled when you use our website.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>2. Information We Collect</h4>
            <p>When you use WanderLust, we may collect the following information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Username, email address,
                    and authentication information when you create an account.</li>
                <li><strong>Listing Information:</strong> Property titles,
                    descriptions, images, prices, locations, and countries
                    submitted by users.</li>
                <li><strong>Review Information:</strong> Ratings and comments
                    submitted by users.</li>
                <li><strong>Technical Information:</strong> Certain technical
                    information, such as browser or session data, may be processed
                    depending on how the website is hosted and configured.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>3. How We Use Your Information</h4>
            <p>Information may be used to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage user accounts.</li>
                <li>Authenticate users and maintain login sessions.</li>
                <li>Display listings and reviews on the platform.</li>
                <li>Allow users to create, edit, and manage their listings.</li>
                <li>Maintain the functionality, security, and performance of the website.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>4. Account Security</h4>
            <p>
                We use authentication tools to manage user accounts. Passwords
                are handled through the authentication system rather than being
                stored as plain-text passwords. However, no method of storing
                or transmitting information can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>5. Cookies and Sessions</h4>
            <p>
                WanderLust may use session cookies to maintain login status
                and support website functionality. You can manage cookies
                through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect
                some website features.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>6. Sharing of Information</h4>
            <p>
                Account details and user-submitted content may be visible to
                other users where necessary for the platform to function.
                We do not describe or promise any third-party data-sharing
                practices here; these should be updated if external services
                or integrations are introduced.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>7. Data Retention</h4>
            <p>
                Information may remain stored in the application's database
                while an account, listing, or review exists. Data deletion
                practices depend on the application's implementation and
                applicable requirements.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>8. Your Choices</h4>
            <p>
                You should keep your account information accurate and protect
                your login credentials. If you have questions or requests
                concerning information associated with your account, please
                contact the website administrator.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>9. Changes to This Policy</h4>
            <p>
                This Privacy Policy may be updated as WanderLust develops.
                Any revised version should be published on this page with
                an updated revision date.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h4>10. Contact Us</h4>
            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please
                contact the WanderLust website administrator.
            </p>
        </section>

    </div>

    <div class="privacy-footer-note">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart me-2"></i>
        Thank you for being part of WanderLust.
    </div>

</div>
